{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_breeze_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_breeze_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"风暖寒林","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_breeze_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"fdc13e77dc9c08a139ba27e613dc20345a3931040fdfc4e958bb7ee85f933f87","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 微风"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"维多利亚西北边境，森林的某处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（总感觉有人一直在跟踪我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哼哼，看我的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！这个脚印是——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杂食性的野兽，牙齿不是特别好。但它的爪子尖锐，通常把猎物撕成肉碎再吞入口中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平时不会攻击人，可如果是冬季食物紧缺的情况......它们说不定会狩猎一些落单的人类......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜啊啊啊 ——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝姐姐——！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜呜不要丢下我一个人啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然是丽塔啊，快过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝姐姐啊！！那边的树丛有动静啊！！一定是野兽！我们是不是要死在这了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，别怕，那是我随便想出来的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就好奇是谁在后面鬼鬼祟祟地跟着我，原来是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝姐姐，不要吓我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没有这样的野兽，但这样偷偷跟出来也是很危险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，你为什么跟踪我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我饿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为饿了，所以跟在我后面找食物？可我看你挺精神的呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸妈妈，没有东西吃，他们把最后一点吃的给了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"采集队的食物呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈早就病了。自从爸爸打猎受伤后，采集队的人就说我们家都是不出力的，就不愿意分给我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"采集队的人说，现在是冬天，根本找不到食物。营地里的储备也不够，除非突然暖和起来，不然食物只会越来越匮乏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（确实是这样。情况越来越不好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果救援再不来的话，到时候......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且......就算我跟着采集队，我也没什么狩猎的贡献。他们根本就不把东西分给我。所以，这几天我就都没去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们竟然这样做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......爸爸妈妈都躺在病床上，又冷，又填不饱肚子，好难受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝姐姐，可以告诉我有哪些是可以吃的吗？我想采一点回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算是杂草也可以，很难吃也没关系，只要能填饱肚子就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，包在我身上！不过，光吃路上能采到的这些还不够，真正要吃饱，还要靠兽肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里爬上爬下的，最后采到的食物，长期来看是不够补偿花费的力气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是我，我抓不到野兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......今天没办法，就先应应急。等明天我带你去北边，试试看能不能抓到一些小型的兽类！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的？谢谢格蕾丝姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，这样爸爸妈妈也能吃饱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别急着谢，作为交换，今天你要乖乖听话，不许乱跑，知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小心脚下！别摔倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在就来找能吃的野菜吧？爸爸妈妈还在等我带吃的回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个植物长得好像野菜，格蕾丝姐姐，这个可以吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这个虽然很像可食用的野菜，但其实是有毒性的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那这边这个呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个也不行，嚼不动的，还会让口腔出血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那这个！这个果子！好鲜艳的，可以吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是瘤眼果，是一种长得很像瘤兽眼睛的浆果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是它不能吃哦。看起来很美味，而且吃进去以后也是甜甜的。但是呢，之后就会让你开始拉肚子，只会越吃越乏力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚一些贵族会拿来当减肥药使用，最终吃得自己精疲力竭，免疫力降低然后患上各种疾病......总之不管饱，反而对人体有害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠让别的物种拉肚子来播撒种子，真是有意思的进化方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜——那怎么办？！根本找不到能吃的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，虽然这果子不能吃，但它的叶子能吃。有点苦，但不会对人体造成什么伤害。水煮，可以去掉一点苦味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我采一点点叶子好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，看来我们运气不错！看我手里，你还可以找点这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是石头吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这石头上面，这是野生苔麦，上面的孢子就像麦穗一样，是可以吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书上说乌萨斯北原上的一些农民会种这种作物，没想到这里也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！我也采一点这个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以多采一点。脱去外壳，然后洗一洗，可以煮成稀粥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果把这里都采光了，之后不就没得吃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苔麦收获期很短的，过了收获期，糖分被吸收，上方的孢子结构成型，作为“麦穗”的部分不再饱满，口味变苦，无法入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那现在的苔麦是好苔麦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，丽塔运气真的很好！不过毕竟是野生的苔麦，数量不多，把这些全采完才够煮一锅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我努力一点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔真了不起，我也会一起帮忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢姐姐！嘿嘿，我要多采一些，然后偷偷藏起来，只给爸爸妈妈吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等我把苔麦采了，就来帮格蕾丝姐姐一起采草药！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那你就在这片平坦区域活动，不要走远了。我去西边的地方看看。有事喊我一嗓子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！丽塔听姐姐的话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（下雨了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好冷，裸露的石头变得好滑。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（该回去看看丽塔了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——在——这——儿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（丽塔的声音怎么这么远？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔？？你在哪儿？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——在——下——面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——不——小——心——滑——下——来——啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有受伤？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乱动啊！我马上下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐——姐——小——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，丽塔刚刚想说那边很滑，让姐姐小心别也踩着石头滑到底下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个坑实在太滑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，姐姐头上长出草了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢？你也要来一点吗？嘿咻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！胡子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈啾！哈——哈——哈啾！呜......格蕾丝姐姐甩过来的叶子，粘到鼻子上了，好痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗！你的鼻涕，鼻涕挂下来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝&丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不笑你了。不过，你在这下面干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上面找不到更多苔麦了，我看到下面还有，就想爬下来多采点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"结果一不小心滑了一跤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受伤了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是屁股着地有点疼，其他地方都没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，那我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是答应我说要听话的吗，我可没让你来这里啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是只够煮一锅也不太够呀。而且万一明天来采的时候已经过了收获期，可不就全浪费了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也要注意自己的安全呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我的篮子也放上边了，所以不用担心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才看到了，所以我也把篮子放那里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挨着丽塔的篮子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，挨着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿嘿，真好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下雨了，来，把这个戴上，别着凉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好大的叶子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚摘的，戴在头上，把你的角从这两个洞洞里钻过去，可以挡雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耳朵凉凉的，感觉有点不舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要摘下来，淋雨的话会感冒的。如果你也病倒了，谁来照顾你的爸爸妈妈呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对，丽塔现在可是顶梁柱！我要好好地喂饱爸爸妈妈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐不戴大叶子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔先戴着好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我很少淋雨，感觉还有点不一样呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，怎么可能以前从来没淋过雨呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚难道是一个不怎么下雨的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在维多利亚，下雨是一件很常见的事情，但我真的很少淋雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如今，秋末的最后一场雨就这样毫无阻拦地落在我的头发上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我比格蕾丝姐姐强！我经常在下雨天帮家里收衣服，干农活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"淋雨的感觉就和被村长训差不多。就像这样，丽塔噗噗，你怎么噗噗这样噗噗噗捣乱噗噗——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，那个村长，的确激动起来会乱喷口水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是村长他现在喷不出来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是太老，又太累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了，那天我偷偷跟着，看到格蕾丝姐姐把村长背出去，很吃力地带到很远的地方，刚刚放下没多久，村长就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像是烧木头时飘起来的烟灰一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸和妈妈会不会也变成那样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求援的队伍已经出发两周，按照我画的地图，应该已经找到附近的城镇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，我今天采了那么多草药，丽塔也采了那么多吃的，你的爸爸妈妈一定不会有事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对哦！丽塔这么努力，爸爸妈妈一定会好起来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，姐姐为什么不让其他人帮忙采草药呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......大家，其实也都像丽塔家一样。现在吃都吃不饱，保障食物大概是大家目前最重要的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以没有人手来帮我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨也好像越来越大了，你的爸爸妈妈会担心你的，你先回去好不好？我可以一个人把需要的草药采完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！我要先把采到的这些带回去了，爸爸妈妈一定也饿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还认得回去的路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然认得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我托你上去，小心点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那姐姐抓住我的手，我把你拉上来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈姐姐比你重太多啦，我可以自己爬上来的！姐姐这里你放心好了，快回去照顾爸爸妈妈吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑太快！小心一点啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......接下来想想我自己的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要用的草药，刚刚之前看到了，就在那边的山崖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下雨了，这个坑对我来说倒不难爬，但那个山崖，我还上得去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼，刚才滑下来的时候脚踝的地方划破了，口子还挺大的，需要先止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那样包扎完后会变得不灵活，就更难爬上山崖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！脚好痛啊......头也有点晕晕的，是最近太累了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔的妈妈，情况很糟糕。她的爸爸受的是外伤，虽然做了紧急处理，但之后伤口仍有感染的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些贵族们不可能不知道有难民进入了领地啊，为什么无动于衷......就算是驱逐......为什么还不露面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难民携带的医疗用品早就用完了，现在全靠我采到的草药来进行简单的治疗，多采一点，就能多帮到一点忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望能撑到求援队伍带着人回来，希望能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不能胡思乱想了。等会儿雨变大就更难爬上那山崖了！必须赶快采到，下来后再包扎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"维多利亚西北边境，难民营地"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉斯家的退烧药，这个份量应该差不多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彼得的牙疼药，只能止疼......这点草药好像有点不够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驱虫的药......啊，怎么少采了一种！一定是饿昏头了。等会再出去采采看吧......外面已经暗下来了，雨也不小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？我的营房门口怎么有个人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝小姐！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！我在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾丝小姐，你才回来啊！有、有人好像突然生了很严重的病！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(不会又是和村长一样的情况吧？)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪里，快带我去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"到了，就是这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔家的营房？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔？你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有回应......手掌烫伤得很严重，手臂上有淤青，后脑勺好肿。嗯......还有点发烧。明明之前还好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么时候发现她这样的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"就刚才，大概二十分钟前吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来丽塔家做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她父母都在治疗区内，这边只有她一个人在给自己父母准备晚饭。你来她这干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......因为她今天没跟着采集队出来，所以我就来看看怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撒谎！她说采集队不给她食物，这几天来她就没跟过采集队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的在意这个，早就应该来了，而不是现在才来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天采的食物呢？为什么不在这个营房内？你是不是闯进来抢走了她的食物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是为了让我家人活下去而已！根本就没多少食物了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道......她反抗得这么厉害......谁知道......她就这样了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的贵族不会不管的。我们派出去求援的队伍应该也差不多到附近城镇了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"就算您说的是真的，在这之前我的孩子们就会受不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不至于，去抢一个小女孩的食物！这是她自己努力采集来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她手掌上的烫伤，是因为怕你要抢，所以直接用手抱住滚烫的汤锅而导致的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她手臂上的淤青，也是你抓的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后脑勺，也是被你推开后撞到了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我又......不是故意要让她受伤的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"她的父母已经不行了！就算她活下来又能怎样？到时候也就只是一个......孤儿！就算一切好起来，她也没法独自活下去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子们，我还算健康！我们能整个家庭活下来，要比她这样来得重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，在你的眼里，生命有轻重之分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我呢，我的命，在你眼里有多重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们似乎一直都在观察着我与我的悼词，小声地讨论着我的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你告诉我，我的这条命，在你眼里有多重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大人！您给我们治病，救了我们，有人猜您应该是维多利亚的贵族......您是我们这儿最尊贵的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是不是应该把你的食物交给我，好让我活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是——很久没好好地吃一顿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不愿意把食物给我，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本就不是在以什么逻辑，什么道理，什么正确性来行事。你只是自私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌自私鬼，更不会帮助强盗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你至少还把这件事报告给我的份上，再给你一次机会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把食物还回来，一点儿也不准少！如果吃了，就补上！不然我保证，救援队伍的车上不会有你的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱塔尼亚难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"是......好的，大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，原来我也能那么自然地说那种吓唬人的谎话。算了，有用就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"营养不良，发烧，外伤，炎症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份已经配好的退烧药，先给丽塔用吧。如果不够，等会再去采一点给治疗区的病人送去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......不要抢走我爸爸妈妈的汤......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔！是我，格蕾丝。我只是借一下你的汤锅，熬药给你吃，不要害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会服下这些汤剂，你就会感觉好一点的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸妈妈的......食物......被......抢走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，食物会回来的。你现在要相信姐姐，好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，我已经帮你吹凉了，丽塔，稍微把嘴张开一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔很棒！嘴角有点流出来了，我帮你擦一擦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过会就会起效的，你先在这里睡一会。我去帮你拿点别的药来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经睡着了吗，药效真快啊。乖乖等着我，我马上就回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的雨啊......真暗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快一点，再晚一点就什么也看不见了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腿好疼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得我要找的草药就在这附近......箭形的叶片，上面有细密的锯齿。啊！是这个吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！洗完了，把这些磨成粉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么一用力就晕晕的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请再坚持一会儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这些草药的配比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，柴火不够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温度......我需要再去拾点柴火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔，丽塔，不要害怕，我现在要喂你一些汤剂，可能稍微会有点......烫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我好像忘记把草药的籽挑出来了......可能还会很苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外敷的药已经给你贴上了。这是消炎的汤剂，喝下去，你会很快好起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让你出事的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吃力地吞咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，丽塔真乖呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":"avg_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好晕......不行了......我、稍微休息一下？......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔......丽塔......一定要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们发现她的时候已经这样了，嘴里一直在念着这个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全身是泥巴，腿部有创伤，以及轻微的矿石病感染症状，是刚感染不久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病感染也是原因之一，但主要还是因为饥饿与极度疲惫才晕倒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据说已经晕了有好几天了。一些难民们说是这小姑娘保护了他们。如果没有她的努力，不可能有这么多人活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难民因为康复后仍有劳动力，可以拜托莱塔尼亚的古尔克先生为他们提供治疗与住所。他需要人手来维护他那个奇怪的城堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些人的家乡受灾严重，现在归乡不太可能，所以大多数难民都接受了这个提议，准备先在古尔克那接受治疗，再看情况要不要回乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也只有像让难民回自己国家这样的正当理由，相关的贵族才不会从中阻挠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个叫丽塔的小女孩，她的母亲已经离世，幸好她残疾的父亲还能继续提供一点劳动力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听附近的天灾信使说罗德岛本舰上的地灵小姐与古尔克是旧识，我会写信让她帮忙求求情，好让这对父女能被纳入他的领地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔珀小姑娘的野路子令人印象深刻，但只是采点草药，懂点临床理论，是无法抑制她自己的矿石病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她把救助难民这件事看得太单纯。想得过于简单，迟早会要了她的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等会帮我联系一下附近的信使，我要寄两封信，一封给罗德岛，另一封送到多伦郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我必须提醒您，维多利亚有贵族为了争夺领地，需要这些难民死在这里。为了保险起见，我们现在明面上不能代表罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤其您还是从维多利亚的医学研讨会上溜出来的，行动必须低调，最好不要节外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原来我参加的是学术研讨会啊。这几天下来我还以为参加的是什么杜林族模仿爱好者举办的品酒会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，对于一些贵族来说，人道主义的光辉是一种潮流，也仅仅是潮流而已。权衡利弊，他们早就做出意料之内的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她太虚弱了。不立刻治疗的话会更多病症会趁虚而入，矿石病的感染也会加速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让她以我助手的身份在维多利亚接受最好的治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然我们的真实身份也会一直对她保密，这样不就行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"助手？我看您是还想把她带在身边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不是什么撑着伞从天而降的维多利亚保姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等她康复后，我会联系专业的地方让她进修医疗技艺，而我还有别的事要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她如果想继续她天真的事业，我也没有什么意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是她作为医者得了矿石病，没得选，总不能继续当一个野路子。至少，她需要学会怎么保护自己。至于她未来会怎样是她自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"随您吧。唉，不过等Scout先生现在的任务完成后，我就要调去他的小队了。有个维多利亚的本地人在你身边管您一段时间也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的小沃尔珀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刀片般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在治疗病人的时候，可比你果决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，而且她的药方在治疗非矿石病的病人时，也非常有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我大概明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"善良、坚强、正直，年纪轻轻却如此有水平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您想保护一种可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我也......真想看看她以后的样子。可惜她醒来之前我应该就已经返程去罗德岛了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢的小沃尔珀，你一定要早点好起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有更多的人在等着你——我也会等待着你的成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在的你应该听不到吧......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想看到你的未来，小沃尔珀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暖阳般的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们有缘，以后还会见面的，也许在罗德岛，也许在别的什么地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"}],"observedOperators":[]}
